      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/graph/propositions/@N004/statement",
      "value": "U=M⊗_ℤ K is a nonzero finite-dimensional K-vector space of dimension n=ell+1>0. There exists a family G:I×I→End_K(U) with all of the following properties: for all i,j,k,l∈I, G_ij G_kl=G_il if j=k and zero otherwise; ∑_{i∈I}G_ii=Id_U; and every K-linear subspace W⊂U invariant under the original induced x,y actions is invariant under all G_ij. The induced h action is the commutator of the induced x and y actions. The representation is precisely the original L_K action, also in characteristic 2."
